    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d}{d t} r (t) + a _ {0} r (t) = b _ {1} \\frac {d}{d t} e (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            406,
            182,
            615,
            205
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "试画出其模拟框图。 $q(t)$ 与 $f(t)$ 关系① $q(t)$ 与 $y(t)$ 关系②",
        "bbox": [
            626,
            188,
            942,
            333
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (t) = q ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 q (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            178,
            346,
            490,
            397
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y (t)} & {= [ q ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 q (t) ] ^ {\\prime} + 3 [ q ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 q (t) ]} \\\\ {y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y (t)} & {= [ q ^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 q (t) ] ^ {\\prime} + 2 [ q ^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 q (t) ]} \\\\ {\\Rightarrow y (t)} & {= q ^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 q (t) \\mathrm{方程右边开式}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            445,
            369,
            919,
            517
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 24: 已知系统微分方程为 $\\frac{d}{dt} r(t) + a_0 r(t) = b_0 e(t) + b_1 \\frac{d}{dt} e(t)$ , 试画出其模拟框图。 取中间变量 $9( t )$ . 使 $e( t )$ 与 $9( t )$ 满足 $e( t ) = 9^{( t ) + a_0 g(t)}$ ①\n\n则 $n( t )$ 与 $9( t )$ 满足 $n( t ) = b_0 g(t) + b_1 g(t)$ ②",
